#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""secret-drop: give secrets to your tools, servers and AI agents without pasting them into a chat.

The value is typed into a native password dialog and written straight to its target. It never
appears in argv, logs or stdout; only its length is reported. `run` hands secrets to a command and
scrubs them from its output, and `guard` (a Claude Code PreToolUse hook) stops an agent from reading
secret files or the keychain behind your back.
"""

